4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
SETTING UP THE PROJECT

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,000
First, open your IDE and create a new project.

6
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:32,000
Select the console application template.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Name your project and click create.

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,000
[Music]

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
WRITING THE CODE

10
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,000
Now let's write some actual code.

11
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:00,000
We'll start with a simple hello world program.

12
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:04,000
Add a Console.WriteLine statement.

13
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,000
[Music]

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
RUNNING AND TESTING

15
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:24,000
Press F5 to run your application.

16
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:28,000
You should see Hello World in the console.

17
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:32,000
Congratulations, you've built your first app.
